Z||000000||Fierozilla||10-26-2001||04:59 PM||||Well I ordered a steel clutch pedal from GMPartsdirect (.com) a couple of days ago. I just got an email from them stating that part (part# 10066423) has been DISCONTINUED.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> They credited my credit card back of course. This is starting to get old; trying to find parts for these things.<BR>Does anybody know where I can get one? Are there any aftermarket ones sold? I really need one, thanks.||||reg||11
