Z||000002||Rodney||10-26-2001||05:42 PM||||There are 2 styles of steel clutch pedals. The early design has the large diameter pin for the banjo. The late steel design which is now sold out has the small pin. I think there are probably a good amount of good used large pin clutch arms around. These can be converterd to the late small pin design with a kit I sell. You cut off the back of the old large pin and pound it out then replace it with my bolt-on small pin conversion part. Not on my web page yet. ||||reg||1
